  "Turn Touch": "Turn Touch",
  "Turn Touch for Android · {0}": "Turn Touch Android 版 · {0}",
  "Turn Touch for Android — Privacy Policy\nEffective October 16, 2026\n\nTurn Touch for Android connects your Turn Touch Bluetooth remote to actions you configure on your phone or tablet. You do not need a Turn Touch account to use the app.\n\nInformation on your device\n\nRemote names, Bluetooth addresses, battery readings, button assignments, and connection settings are stored on your device. Integration credentials are encrypted with an Android Keystore key. Automatic Android backup is disabled. The app keeps recent connection and action diagnostics locally; it does not send them to Turn Touch.\n\nConnections you choose\n\nThe app sends commands to the smart-home devices and services you configure. These may include Hue, Nanoleaf, Sonos, Govee, Kasa, WeMo, Bose, IFTTT, and your own HTTP endpoints. Depending on the integration, commands travel over your local network or to a provider's cloud service. Requests may include device identifiers, authentication credentials, action settings, or webhook values you provide. These providers handle requests under their own privacy policies. Some local devices use unencrypted HTTP or local network protocols; use them only on a trusted network.\n\nWeb content\n\nPages you open inside the app connect directly to those websites. They may use cookies and receive your IP address, browser information, and any information you enter. Their privacy policies apply. Turn Touch does not receive your browsing content.\n\nPermissions and media\n\nNearby-device permissions allow Bluetooth discovery and connection. Android 11 and earlier require location permission for Bluetooth scanning; Turn Touch does not obtain GPS location. A foreground-service notification keeps a paired remote available while the app is in the background. Camera permission is optional and used only for the camera feature. Photos and silent videos you capture are saved to your device's media library, not uploaded by Turn Touch. The app can also adjust media volume and send alarm requests to your selected alarm app.\n\nNo advertising or analytics\n\nTurn Touch for Android includes no advertising, analytics, tracking, or automatic crash-reporting SDK. We do not sell your information or receive a copy of your remote configuration, credentials, or captured media.\n\nYour choices\n\nYou can remove paired remotes, change integration settings, and revoke permissions in Android Settings. Clearing the app's storage or uninstalling it removes its saved configuration and credentials. Photos and videos saved to your media library remain until you delete them there. Any data sent to a third-party service is subject to that provider's retention and deletion controls.\n\nChildren\n\nThis app is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children under 13. Turn Touch does not knowingly collect children's personal information through this Android app.\n\nChanges and contact\n\nThis policy applies to Turn Touch for Android version 1.0. We will update the policy if the app's data practices change. For privacy questions, contact samuel@turntouch.com.\n": "Turn Touch for Android — 隐私政策\n生效日期：2026 年 10 月 16 日\n\nTurn Touch for Android 可将 Turn Touch 蓝牙遥控器连接到您在手机或平板电脑上配置的操作。使用此应用无需 Turn Touch 账户。\n\n设备上的信息\n\n遥控器名称、蓝牙地址、电池电量、按键分配和连接设置均存储在您的设备上。集成服务凭据使用 Android Keystore 密钥加密。Android 自动备份已停用。应用会在本地保留近期连接和操作诊断信息，不会将其发送给 Turn Touch。\n\n您选择的连接\n\n应用会向您配置的智能家居设备和服务发送指令，其中可能包括 Hue、Nanoleaf、Sonos、Govee、Kasa、WeMo、Bose、IFTTT 以及您自己的 HTTP 端点。根据集成方式，指令会通过本地网络发送，或发送到服务提供商的云服务。请求可能包含您提供的设备标识符、身份验证凭据、操作设置或 webhook 值。相关提供商会依据各自的隐私政策处理请求。部分本地设备使用未加密的 HTTP 或本地网络协议；请仅在可信网络中使用。\n\n网页内容\n\n您在应用内打开的网页会直接连接到相应网站。这些网站可能使用 Cookie，并获取您的 IP 地址、浏览器信息及您输入的任何信息。其隐私政策适用。Turn Touch 不会收到您的浏览内容。\n\n权限和媒体\n\n附近设备权限用于发现和连接蓝牙设备。Android 11 及更早版本需要位置权限才能扫描蓝牙设备；Turn Touch 不会获取 GPS 位置。前台服务通知可确保应用在后台运行时仍能连接已配对的遥控器。相机权限为可选，仅用于相机功能。您拍摄的照片和静音视频会保存到设备的媒体库，Turn Touch 不会上传这些内容。应用还可以调节媒体音量，并向您选择的闹钟应用发送闹钟请求。\n\n无广告或分析\n\nTurn Touch for Android 不含广告、分析、跟踪或自动崩溃报告 SDK。我们不会出售您的信息，也不会收到您的遥控器配置、凭据或拍摄媒体的副本。\n\n您的选择\n\n您可以移除已配对的遥控器、更改集成设置，并在 Android 设置中撤销权限。清除应用存储空间或卸载应用会删除已保存的配置和凭据。保存到媒体库的照片和视频会保留，直到您在那里将其删除。发送给第三方服务的任何数据均受该提供商的数据保留和删除规则约束。\n\n儿童\n\n此应用面向普通受众，不以 13 岁以下儿童为目标用户。Turn Touch 不会通过此 Android 应用故意收集儿童的个人信息。\n\n政策变更与联系方式\n\n本政策适用于 Turn Touch for Android 1.0 版。如果应用的数据处理方式发生变化，我们将更新本政策。如有隐私问题，请联系 samuel@turntouch.com。\n",
  "Turn Touch now speaks 21 languages. Choose your language when you first open the app, or change it from Language at the top of Settings. Menus, actions, and settings are translated. Automatic follows your device language, with English as the fallback.": "Turn Touch 现已支持 21 种语言。首次打开应用时选择语言，也可在“设置”顶部的“语言”中更改。菜单、操作和设置均已翻译。“自动”会跟随设备语言，默认使用英语。",
